	XSTR("When designing the primary cannon for the A/SF-01 B-wing, Gyrhil was able to focus their efforts on maximizing the bolt's speed and hull penetration characteristics.  The result is a powerful anti-capital ship weapon that produces turbolaser-grade bolts for starfighter-grade power costs.  The tradeoff lies in the targeting and aim-assist systems: it is almost impossible to land R-9X bolts on anything smaller than a transport.  When it comes to punching through heavy armor, though, the R-9X is in a field all its own.", 1038)
