	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Found on a wide variety of vessels, the Taim & Bak KT6 heavy blaster cannon can, against unshielded light targets, deliver a punch comparable to that of a light laser cannon at a fraction of the power draw.  This, along with its high rate of fire, has earned the KT6 tremendous popularity among buyers who don't expect action against harder targets, or who plan to use the blaster as a supplement to heavier guns.  Ideal roles for the KT6 include cover fire and point defense.", 1044)
