$Name:	Gyrhil 72 ; 1.8 km, 74 dps (*1.85 ->136 starfighter hull, fades over distance)  ; auto blaster for B-wing
	$Display Name:			   Gyrhil 72 Blaster
	+Title:                    XSTR("Gyrhil 72 Blaster Cannon", 1046)
	+Description:
	XSTR("Specialized Blaster Cannon
	Rate of Fire: Very High | Power Usage: Very Low
	Damage: High Hull & Subsystem, Low Shield", 1047)
	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Gyrhil 72 Blaster Cannon", 1046)
	+Tech Anim:                Gyrhil_72
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Designed as a defensive weapon for the A/SF-01 B-wing, the Gyrhil 72 is a highly specialized weapon built for short-range anti-fighter work.  Leveraging new developments in blaster cooling, the designers were able to create a weapon with an unusually high rate of fire even for a blaster cannon--which reduced the necessary power of each bolt, in turn allowing the aim-assist module to alter the bolt trajectory significantly more than would ordinarily be possible.  As a consequence, the Gyrhil 72 can hit targets up to 7.5 degrees off bore, a capability which pilots of the slow-turning B-wing find exceptionally useful.", 1048)
	$end_multi_text
