	XSTR("The All-Terrain Armored Transport's primary armament consists of a pair of chin-mounted Taim & Bak MS-1 laser cannons, heavy siege weapons built first and foremost for raw power.  The AT-AT is regularly called upon to neutralize well-armored static defenses from considerable range, and the MS-1--a surprisingly accurate weapon--excels at this task.  Of course, the cannon's sheer size requires it to be bolted directly to the walker's head, so its effectiveness against fast-moving targets is sharply limited by the head's traversal speed.", 3012)
