	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Taim & Bak FF-4 Blaster Cannon", 3009)
	+Tech Anim:                TB_FF4
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The FF-4 medium repeating blaster is the AT-AT's solution to the presence of light or fast-moving hostile units, or simply any target against which the MS-1 would be overkill.  While the walker's two FF-4s--mounted in turrets on the temples--enjoy a greater field of fire than the main guns, they are still, fundamentally, offensive weapons, not designed to defend the AT-AT against nimble threats in close quarters.  Rather, Imperial doctrine calls for AT-ATs to be deployed in an artillery role well away from enemy positions, supported by air cover and lighter walkers.", 3013)
	$end_multi_text
