	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The Sienar Fleet Systems SFS L-s8.1 is the most recent example of a balanced ion weapon.  The Imperial Navy commmissioned the weapon in response to the increasing importance of ship capture in the context of the Rebel conflict.  Building an ion cannon compatible with the compact energy systems of the TIE series proved challenging at first, and prototype models frequently caused electrical overloads.  In the end, the power regulation challenges limited the weapon to use aboard the larger V38 and TIE/sa Bomber craft.", 1072)
