$Name:	CEC AG-2G ;2 km, 120 dps (2 shots)
	$Display Name:			   AG-2G Cannon
	+Title:                    XSTR("CEC AG-2G Laser Cannon", 1082)
	+Description:
	XSTR("Ball Mounted Laser Cannon: Automatically Operated
	Rate of Fire: High | Power Usage: Very High
	Damage: Moderate Hull, Subsystem & Shield", 1083)
	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("CEC AG-2G Laser Cannon", 1082)
	+Tech Anim:                AG-2G
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The Corellian Engineering Corporation AG-2G Laser Cannon is a powerful, compact anti-starfighter weapon.  While it was originally designed during the Clone Wars as part of an aftermarket retrofit kit for the Republic's DP-20 Gunships, most AG-2G units were later sold off individually when the Imperial Starfleet began awarding most of its contracts to Kuat Drive Yards and Sienar Fleet Systems.  With a high rate of fire, these weapons are far more effective than turbolasers in the point-defense role.  The four cannons' shared coolant pool and capacitor bank make the weapon significantly more cost-effective, and the system can be mounted on almost any ship with a free hardpoint and enough power.  Officially, the AG-2G is a military weapon restricted to warships; unofficially, it enjoys more popularity with criminals and those they prey on than almost any other turreted laser.", 1084)
	$end_multi_text
