	$Shield Factor: 			  1.0
	$Subsystem Factor: 			  1.0
	$Lifetime: 					  2.0
	$Lifetime Curve:
		+Input: Base Velocity
		+Output: Laser Length Mult
		+Curve Name: C_Laser_Length
	$Lifetime Curve:
		+Input: Base Damage
		+Output: Laser Radius Mult
