#Secondary Weapons

; NOTES:
	; Secondaries use shockwave damage. 
	; Large warheads have particle shockwave damage that fighter armor protects against.
	; This to prevents small ships from blowing themselves up accidentally. 
	; Small warheads do have fighter damaging shockwaves since they are designed to hit small ships.

$Name:	Arakyd ST2#Orn ; 1.8 km, 110 d (x2 for shockwave) ;cheap and massable
