	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Dymek HM-6a Concussion Missile", 1117)
	+Tech Anim:                HM-6
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Shortly after the HM-6 hit the market, Dymek's management became aware that some users had taken to removing the tracking hardware from their missiles in order to bypass the target acquisition stage, allowing them to be fired as quickly as the launcher could load.  Rather than running the risk of their best customers blowing themselves up while tampering with their merchandise, Dymek immediately rolled out the HM-6a, a 'dumb' variant of the design that can safely (for the user) empty itself in less than two seconds.", 1119)
	$end_multi_text
