	+Tech Anim:                MG7-A
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The Krupx MG7-A Proton Torpedo is an effective and well known warhead.  Even after nearly 50 years of continuous production, the age of its design has not yet begun to show.  A single fighter able to carry this torpedo can pose a serious threat to ships as large as corvettes, and a full squadron of torpedo-armed fighters is capable of devastating a frigate with a coordinated assault.  Its cost far exceeds that of a typical concussion missile, but its ubiquity and ease of use make it a tempting all-purpose alternative to heavier, less flexible ordnance.", 1123)
	$end_multi_text
