$Name:	Arakyd ADM-77 ; 5.0 km, 1500 d (x2 for shockwave) for cap ships only
	$Display Name:			   ADM Torpedo
	+Title:                    XSTR("Arakyd ADM-77 Warhead", 1129)
	+Description:
	XSTR("Capital Ship Torpedo
	Lock Time: Very Slow | Maneuverability: Very Low
	Damage: Very High Hull, Subsys & Shield", 1130)
	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Arakyd ADM-77 Warhead", 1129)
	+Tech Anim:                VL-4a
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The Arakyd ADM-77 (or Auxiliary Destroyer Munition) is a high-yield torpedo designed exclusively for capital-scale torpedo launchers.  Built around a large warhead and optimized for use against heavy targets, the torpedo is capable of breaching cruiser-grade armor with a single hit.  As a ship-to-ship weapon, the ADM-77 lacks the speed or agility necessary for use against nimble targets like starfighters, though its tracking capabilities are more than adequate to produce a high hit rate against its intended targets.  A device such as this is incredibly expensive, but for militaries expecting fleet combat, there is no substitute.", 1131)
	$end_multi_text
