	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Dymek HM-8 Proton Torpedo", 1132)
	+Tech Anim:                HM-8
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("The Dymek HM-8 is a heavy torpedo, one of the only true rivals to the Krupx MG7-A.  Like the manufacturer's more popular concussion missiles, the HM-8 does not maintain a link with its targeting computer after launch, making it less accurate than its competition.  The system's primary advantage is that the HM-8 needs significantly less time to acquire a target lock, meaning bombing runs under enemy fire are far more survivable.  While nearly a heavy rocket both in terms of cost and warhead yield, the HM-8 is compatible with a greater variety of platforms.", 1134)
