	XSTR("The Frei-Tek Ion Torpedo is a highly effective anti-capital ion warhead.  Building upon their experience developing the anti-fighter Magnetic Pulse, Frei-Tek built the IR-4 specifically for disabling large ships.  Upon warhead detonation, a massive ion discharge is released, inflicting significant damage to shields and subsystems.  A precise hit can cripple even massive warships.  Though commonly under-utilized, the IR-4 Ion Torpedo is a valuable weapon for bomber squadrons.  ", 1143)
