	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("Merr-Sonn NG2 Heavy Rocket", 1146)
	+Tech Anim:                NG2
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("First seen in the Clone Wars, the Merr-Sonn NG2 is a highly effective anti-capital warhead.  Significantly more powerful than even high-yield proton torpedoes, this heavy rocket is a complicated weapon that detonates in multiple stages, making it more effective than typical warheads against shields--though it still performs best against hull plating.  Unfortunately, the NG2 is almost useless against fighter craft due to its lack of speed and maneuverability, and its prohibitive cost usually prevents it from being issued to units not stationed on Star Destroyers.", 1147)
	$end_multi_text
