$Name:	S-K INTR#Red ; 3.5 km, 1500 d (x2 for shockwave)
	$Display Name:					  INTR Rocket
	+Title: XSTR("Slayn & Korpil INTR Rocket", 1148)
	+Description:
	XSTR("Low Cost Anti-Capital Rocket
	Lock Time: Very Slow | Maneuverability: Very Low
	Damage: Very High Hull & Subsys, Very Low Shield", 1149)
	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title: XSTR("Slayn & Korpil INTR Rocket", 1148)
	+Tech Anim: Intr
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Slayn & Korpil's INTR Rocket is a powerful anti-cap weapon that must be delivered when the target's shields are down to have an appreciable effect.  Though it was originally offered to the Alliance by the Rebel-sympathizing corporation, ISB agents (in an unusual reversal of roles) stole the design and gave the plans to Sienar.  As a result of this theft, Black Sun was able to acquire the missile to sell to third parties, making the INTR, commonly referred to as the 'S-K INTR', one of the more common heavy weapons of the Galactic Civil War.  The Sienar variant is often loaded onto TIE/sa Bombers when the Merr-Sonn NG2 is unavailable.", 1150)
	$end_multi_text
