$Name:	ArmaTek VL-61/79#Cyn ; 1 km, 1000 d (x2 for shockwave)
	$Display Name:					  VL Bomb
	+Title:                    XSTR("ArmaTek VL-61/79 Proton Bomb (Compact)", 1152)
	+Description:
	XSTR("Standard Issue Magnetized Bomb
	Rapid Drop Deployment | Maneuverability: None
	Damage: Very High Hull, Shield & Subsys", 1153)
	$end_multi_text
	+Tech Title:               XSTR("ArmaTek VL-61/79 Proton Bomb", 1154)
	+Tech Anim:                DaBomb
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Whether employed against capital ships or as part of an orbital bombardment, ArmaTek's VL-61/79 proton bombs are the most feared weapon in an assault bomber's arsenal.  Though slow-moving and unguided, these devices are powerful enough to rival heavy rockets and small enough to be carried in large amounts.  With its full load of bombs, a single bomber carries enough firepower to inflict considerable damage on targets as large as an Imperial-class Star Destroyer, assuming the pilot survives long enough to empty his bomb bays.", 1155)
	$end_multi_text
