	+Tech Anim:                XX-23
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("A highly specialized explosive, the Krupx S-1 Seismic Charge is extremely effective at clearing a wide area.  The initial detonation triggers a secondary explosion a moment later, releasing a powerful shockwave that deals catastrophic damage to anything it strikes.  Prohibitively expensive and highly unsafe without proper handling, these charges are most often used in mining or debris-clearing roles, though military vessels--and, very occasionally, the operators of private craft--have been known to keep a supply on hand as defensive weapons.", 1158)
