	+Tech Title:				   XSTR("XX-23 Homing Beacon", 1160)
	+Tech Anim:					   XX-23
	+Tech Description:
	XSTR("Neuro-Saav Technologies' XX-23 is a small but tremendously expensive unit which is designed to broadcast a continuous signal that can be received by HoloNet s-threads.  Housed in a sturdy Krupx munitions canister, the device can be attached to a target vessel even in a combat zone by magnetically sealing itself to the ship's outer hull.  The XX-23 is typically set to self-destruct upon atmospheric reentry or engine shutdown to prevent the target from learning that it was tracked.", 1162)
