	;"Healing will always carry. Unlike damage, which first has to go through the shield, 
	; has damage subtracted, then damages subsystems, has damage subtracted, then finally damages the hull if any damage remains, 
	; healing will apply in full to hull, shield, and subsystems (factors or armor classes notwithstanding). 
	; A weapon with 100 'healing' will attempt to apply that healing to the hull, shield and nearby subsystems to the impact. 
	; Even if the weapon only heals hull, it will still do so even if it strikes the shield."

